This repository is a throughline *source*: a requirements graph, not a program. It
re-expresses the official Angular Style Guide as a grounded IDD graph so consuming
projects can compose it with throughline.

The Angular Style Guide is published by Google under the Creative Commons Attribution
4.0 International License. The rule text re-expressed here in items'
`text`/`attrs.source_ref` is derived from that guide and remains the work of Google and
the Angular contributors; this repository claims no ownership over that content and
reproduces it for interoperability. See https://angular.dev/style-guide for the
authoritative source.
